# Enforce LF line endings for text files on every platform.
#
# Blobs in this repository are committed with LF endings. Without this file,
# git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks files out with CRLF, which makes
# `gofmt -l .` in CI flag every .go file and otherwise changes bytes that the
# LF-only tests assert on. eol=lf guarantees byte-identical LF checkouts on
# Linux, Windows, and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf